      "type": "heading",
      "text": "[ PASSOFF- 063 ]"
    },
    {
      "type": "instruction",
      "text": "(My Teacher’s Personality)"
    },
    {
      "type": "hints",
      "text": "My teacher is from Kang-won province."
    },
    {
      "type": "instruction",
      "text": "Sometimes, he speaks with a funny accent!"
    },
    {
      "type": "instruction",
      "text": "He is tall. His hair is black."
    },
    {
      "type": "instruction",
      "text": "He has a habit of touching his nose, biting his nails,"
    },
    {
      "type": "instruction",
      "text": "scratching his nails, cracking his knuckles,"
    },
    {
      "type": "instruction",
      "text": "rubbing his eyes, etc. when he teaches."
    },
    {
      "type": "instruction",
      "text": "I think he likes the color blue because he always wears a blue tie."
    },
    {
      "type": "instruction",
      "text": "He is very kind, and I like him a lot."
    },
    {
